{"id":"merari","name":"Merari","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:merari"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Merari","text":"Sad; bitter, the youngest son of Levi, born before the descent of Jacob into Egypt, and one of the seventy who accompanied him thither (Gen. 46:11; Ex. 6:16). He became the head of one of the great divisions of the Levites (Ex. 6:19). (See MERARITES.)"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H4847","lemma":"מְרָרִי","xlit":"Mᵉrârîy","gloss":"Merari, an Israelite","kjv":"Merari. See also H4848","count":4,"share":0.8},{"strong":"H1648","lemma":"גֵּרְשׁוֹן","xlit":"Gêrᵉshôwn","gloss":"Gereshon or Gereshom, an Israelite","kjv":"Gershon, Gershom","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H6955","lemma":"קְהָת","xlit":"Qᵉhâth","gloss":"Kehath, an Israelite","kjv":"Kohath","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H3878","lemma":"לֵוִי","xlit":"Lêvîy","gloss":"Levi, a son of Jacob","kjv":"Levi. See also H3879, H3881","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","xlit":"mishpâchâh","gloss":"a family","kjv":"family, kind","count":2,"share":0.4}],"verses":["Gen.46.11","Num.3.17","Num.3.33","Num.3.35","Num.3.34"],"related":[{"id":"levites","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"census","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.067,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"gershon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1648","why":"both lead with גֵּרְשׁוֹן (H1648)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":1,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntII.7","count":1,"book":"Ant. 2","title":"The Removal Of Joseph's Father With All His Family, To Him, On Account Of The Famine."}]}]}
